{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0063","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":3,"subject":"math","topic_key":"derivative_applications","total_weight":24,"expected_output":"screening-0063.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1464","source_sha256":"151af954a214eb54cacabd2e510eb0a71c69852c8a2f5296652c0c6d341ba457","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"تابع $f$ پیوسته و نمودار مشتق آن به صورت مقابل است. نمودار $f$ کدام می‌تواند باشد؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/stem_1.webp","alt":"نمودار مشتق","aspect_ratio":1.1951}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار ۱"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/option_1_2.webp","alt":"نمودار گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":1.5349}],[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار ۲"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/option_2_3.webp","alt":"نمودار گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":1.4492}],[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار ۳"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/option_3_4.webp","alt":"نمودار گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":1.8725}],[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار ۴"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/option_4_5.webp","alt":"نمودار گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":1.5727}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به نمودار $f'$، مشخص است که $f'_-(0) = +\\infty$ و $f'_+(0) = -\\infty$.\nبنابراین تابع $f$ در $x = 0$ دارای مماس قائم بوده، در سمت راست صفر اکیداً نزولی و در سمت چپ صفر اکیداً صعودی است. ۳ درست است."}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"d6ed0a7cca2c615f9bfe2b855bfa03359620ad41db7c25c17bd430bcf300e7a4","bytes":1930},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"c0eb747df6fc51c46fbfd1ef3af0a2344d1374c2377cec629b2e2d19eba66f6e","bytes":1986},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"17a6cddff24b2ee15b0e4d2a6890dc9b944cdebe02c4cd7bc09215c0f8f7fd40","bytes":1850},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"467549a41ec84f21da1e53e97a71ff72f0c183cef62e8eeb4b6f85f84c8ef43e","bytes":1626},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1464/stem_1.webp","sha256":"0c32e9b1d949ffe71e417a4725aed2b0b7ce0b56900f8367f130c1ac88988545","bytes":1866}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1464,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":17,"solution_page":136,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1465","source_sha256":"8d744a5a8ea95d3e937373d5af577e8a9f0c7ffd2b0ba66892f2a050af1c987c","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"در شکل مقابل، نمودار تابع $f(x)=x^2-6x+a$ و مشتق آن رسم شده است. حاصل $a+b$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1465/stem_1.webp","alt":"نمودار تابع و مشتق آن","aspect_ratio":0.9612}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"12"}],[{"type":"text","text":"14"}],[{"type":"text","text":"10"}],[{"type":"text","text":"8"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"تابع $f(x) = x^2 - 6x + a$ و در نتیجه $f'(x) = 2x - 6$ می‌باشد. تابع $f'$ در $b$ بر تابع $f$ مماس شده است؛ بنابراین:\n$\\begin{cases} \\text{برابری شیب‌ها} : f''(b) = f'(b) \\Rightarrow 2 = 2b - 6 \\Rightarrow b = 4 \\\\ \\text{برابری مقادیر} : f'(b) = f(b) \\Rightarrow 2b - 6 = b^2 - 6b + a \\end{cases}$\n$\\Rightarrow 2 = 16 - 24 + a \\Rightarrow a = 10 \\Rightarrow a+b = 14$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1465/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1465/stem_1.webp","sha256":"2a004e0549ab48d3bb709796247d208872dd21d654d0becacea980ee4ad9ab11","bytes":3722}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1465,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":17,"solution_page":136,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1466","source_sha256":"e81e748767cf6b07e5a1a9b76c98bfa52b9eb19ffbd053fb4feca49bf5848c9b","subject":"math","section_id":"math_calculus","source_topic_key":"derivative_applications","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"نمودار مشتق تابع $f$ شکل روبه‌رو است. اگر نمودار $f$ و $f'$ بر هم مماس باشند، مقدار $f(2)$ کدام است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1466/stem_1.webp","alt":"نمودار مشتق تابع f","aspect_ratio":0.9957}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"14"}],[{"type":"text","text":"8"}],[{"type":"text","text":"4"}],[{"type":"text","text":"12"}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"با توجه به نمودار، تابع خطی $f'$ به صورت $f'(x) = 4x - 4$ می‌باشد. بنابراین: $f(x) = 2x^2 - 4x + a$\nفرض می‌کنیم $f$ و $f'$ در نقطۀ $x=b$ بر هم مماس‌اند؛ پس در نقطۀ $b$ داریم:\n$\\begin{cases} \\text{برابری شیب‌ها} : f''(b) = f'(b) \\Rightarrow 4 = 4b - 4 \\Rightarrow b = 2 \\\\ \\text{برابری مقادیر} : f'(b) = f(b) \\Rightarrow 4b - 4 = 2b^2 - 4b + a \\end{cases}$\n$\\Rightarrow 4 = 8 - 8 + a \\Rightarrow a=4$\n$f(2) = 8 - 8 + 4 = 4$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1466/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1466/stem_1.webp","sha256":"ee997a3c5aec0fdf0ff1e70c9421382cfdc49f127d1cf0820486b29579ccc868","bytes":2740}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1466,"question_pdf":"11.pdf","question_page":17,"solution_page":136,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true}]}
